-- Bug Hunt puzzles #1-#7 on the same dates. solution holds the 0-based buggy line and its fix.
on conflict (number, format) do nothing;

-- Output puzzles #1-#7. solution holds the choices and the index of the answer.
on conflict (number, format) do nothing;

-- Fill puzzles #1-#7. solution holds the choices and the index of the answer.
on conflict (number, format) do nothing;
